# Premium UX Rules (Web)

- Animations
  - Use spring physics; import shared SPRING_CONFIG where available
  - Prefer `framer-motion` for entrance/hover/tap states

- Accessibility
  - Ensure buttons have accessible labels; role/aria where applicable
  - Form inputs must have labels; validation errors shown with text

- Performance
  - Lazy-load heavy components; split non-critical sections
  - Avoid blocking rendering with synchronous long tasks

- Imports
  - Use `@/` alias (maps to `apps/web/src`)
  - Guard browser APIs and window-dependent code
